# Check dust-specific outputs and diagnostics.
#
# This case focuses on dust plotfile, statistics, and diagnostic output controls to confirm the module writes the intended fields.
#
# Expected result:
#   - Requested dust outputs are produced with the configured names and cadence.
#   - No unexpected omissions occur in the main dust diagnostics.
#
# Configuration:
#   - Output prefix, interval, and variable-selection settings are emphasized.
#   - Physics setup remains secondary to output verification.
